>> Product := Chinthu chatsopano.
Product chikafika: ['a'] chitani: { :price
	Zotuluka lembani: ['cost ']+ price.
}.
>> Apples := Product chatsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: ['Apples cost: '].
Apples a 60.
Zotuluka lembani: [' cent a piece.'].
Nambala chikafika: ['X'] chitani: { :b
	b × wekha.
}.
7 X { :i Zotuluka lembani: i. }.
